{"title":"2024 Indonesia MO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Day_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Day_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Problem_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 8</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_1\">Day 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Day 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Find all ordered pair of positive real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> which satisfy the following system of equations.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776774f4e4e6c16a2513590cdd3c951e7839caf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{aligned} \\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b}&amp;=6 \\\\ \\sqrt{a-5}+\\sqrt{b-5}&amp;=4 \\end{aligned}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"168\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Triplet of positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80414f2f94f70731e91b6e12c4e6934c8fa65de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c286a6b2750b9c5c514b55b7f52660b1f66c21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b &lt; c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> is called <i>fatal</i> if there exist\nthree non-zero integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/48689d638ddca59030006d362cbd848607f63aa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q, r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" /> which satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f50247ee70841dfe3764ddb8b562ddcd81197b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^pb^qc^r=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />. For example, (2,3,12) is fatal triplet since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd672f4a05c613c3899d4e103b0e97b703bd628d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^23^112^{-1}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is called fatal if there exist fatal triplet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/0/d80414f2f94f70731e91b6e12c4e6934c8fa65de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/a/f1a6314d9e7e1e712f1deb1a9c6e296e7f833881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Prove that 16 is not fatal.</li>\n<li>Prove that every integer greater than 16 that is <b>not</b> a multiple of 6 is fatal.</li></ol>\n<p><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_2\">Day 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Day 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO\">2024 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_Indonesia_MO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Indonesia MO (page does not exist)\">2023 Indonesia MO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl